messages.en:
{07 16 00}When watering your flowers,{01 00 00 0a 00}
be sure to water the
wilted ones, too.
{07 15 00}Though they're droopy,{01 00 00 0a 00}
they still want to look
their best, {01 00 00 05 00}{04 02 00}!

messages.et:
{07 16 00}Kui sa lilli kastad,{01 00 00 0a 00}
kasta kindlasti ka
närtsinuid.
{07 15 00}Kuigi nad on longus,{01 00 00 0a 00}
tahavad nad ikka
ilusad olla, {01 00 00 05 00}{04 02 00}!

messages.en:
{07 0b 00}{01 00 00 0a 00}You know those flowers that
don't need watering{01 00 00 05 00} or
attention, {01 00 00 05 00}{04 02 00}?
{07 19 00}{01 00 00 05 00}I think those are much
prettier than the ones that{01 00 00 0a 00}
grow in gardens!{07 00 00}

messages.et:
{07 0b 00}{01 00 00 0a 00}Tead neid lilli, mis ei
vaja kastmist{01 00 00 05 00} ega
hoolt, {01 00 00 05 00}{04 02 00}?
{07 19 00}{01 00 00 05 00}Minu arust on need palju
ilusamad kui need, mis{01 00 00 0a 00}
kasvavad aedades!{07 00 00}

messages.en:
{07 0e 00}I remember a movie about{01 00 00 0a 00}
watering flowers.

{06 01 00 1a 1b 1c}

messages.et:
{07 0e 00}Mäletan filmi{01 00 00 0a 00}
lillede kastmisest.

{06 01 00 1a 1b 1c}

messages.en:
{07 0c 00}{01 00 00 0a 00}You know what I like best?{01 00 00 0a 00}
A single rose held between
the teeth{01 00 00 05 00}.{01 00 00 05 00}.{01 00 00 05 00}.{01 00 00 05 00}
{07 0a 00}You can come by anytime{01 00 00 0a 00}
with a different color rose
between your teeth!

{07 15 00}In order to achieve beauty,{01 00 00 0a 00}
one must be surrounded by
it since youth.
{07 19 00}This applies to both people
and flowers alike, 
{01 00 00 0a 00}{04 02 00}!{07 00 00}

messages.et:
{07 15 00}Ilu saavutamiseks{01 00 00 0a 00}
peab olema sellest
ümbritsetud juba noorena.
{07 19 00}See kehtib nii inimeste
kui lillede kohta,
{01 00 00 0a 00}{04 02 00}!{07 00 00}
